INSERT INTO `jokes` VALUES (1,1,3,'Genz joke','I\'m not lazy, I\'m just in power-saving mode.','VN','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',3,'2026-11-09 11:58:53',0,'2026-10-18 18:23:12','2026-10-18 18:23:12','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(2,2,1,'The Programming Cat','A programmer\'s cat walks across the keyboard and accidentally fixes three race conditions and commits to main.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 12:41:26',0,'2026-10-18 09:50:56','2026-10-18 09:50:56','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(3,5,1,'The Deadline Illusion','Nothing accelerates human problem-solving quite like a deadline that is officially scheduled for twenty minutes ago.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 12:41:26',0,'2026-10-18 16:22:38','2026-10-18 16:22:38','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(4,6,1,'Coffee and Code','I turn caffeine into clean code. Well, usually caffeine into code, and code into more caffeine.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 12:41:26',0,'2026-10-20 17:07:50','2026-10-20 17:07:50','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(5,7,1,'Wi-Fi Connection','My Wi-Fi went down for five minutes yesterday. I spent time with my family; they seem like lovely people.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 12:41:26',0,'2026-10-20 08:01:47','2026-10-20 08:01:47','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(6,8,1,'Group Project Reality','In every group project, one person does 90% of the work, one person disappears, and one person changes the font size at the end.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 12:41:27',0,'2026-10-20 08:57:28','2026-10-20 08:57:28','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(7,9,1,'Computer and Mind','My computer has twenty tabs open, three music players running, and is still cooler under pressure than I am before an exam.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 12:41:27',0,'2026-10-20 21:27:23','2026-10-20 21:27:23','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(8,10,1,'The Job Interview','Interviewer: What is your greatest strength? Candidate: I can maintain eye contact with error messages for twelve consecutive hours.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 12:41:27',0,'2026-10-20 08:07:47','2026-10-20 08:07:47','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(9,11,1,'Monday Morning Syndrome','Monday morning is that special time when you realise your weekend was actually just a brief pause between meetings.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 12:41:27',0,'2026-10-22 12:46:52','2026-10-22 12:46:52','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(10,12,1,'Learning New Languages','I tried learning a foreign language, but my brain\'s auto-complete kept defaulting to sarcastic remarks.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 12:41:27',0,'2026-10-22 12:32:31','2026-10-22 12:32:31','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(11,13,1,'The Mysterious Bug','There are two states of software development: 1. Why does this not work? 2. Why on earth does this work?','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 12:41:27',0,'2026-10-22 15:43:10','2026-10-22 15:43:10','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(12,14,1,'The Cloud Explained','There is no cloud. It is just somebody else\'s very expensive computer sitting in a chilled warehouse.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 12:41:27',0,'2026-10-22 11:37:33','2026-10-22 11:37:33','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(13,15,1,'Tea vs Coffee Debate','Coffee gives you energy to tackle problems. Tea gives you the patience to accept that the problems are self-inflicted.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 12:41:27',0,'2026-10-25 16:19:54','2026-10-25 16:19:54','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(14,16,1,'The Elevator Pitch','My elevator pitch was so convincing that even the elevator decided to stop between the third and fourth floors.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:40',0,'2026-10-25 15:38:36','2026-10-25 15:38:36','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(15,17,1,'The Smart Fridge','My smart fridge just sent a notification saying I need more vegetables. I unplugged it for unsolicited personal advice.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:40',0,'2026-10-25 09:37:03','2026-10-25 09:37:03','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(16,18,1,'Gym Motivation','I bought gym shoes six months ago. So far, they have successfully run to the fridge and jogged to the sofa.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:40',0,'2026-10-25 14:43:47','2026-10-25 14:43:47','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(17,19,2,'Alarm Clock Philosophy','An alarm clock is an electronic device designed to wake you up so you can decide how much you actually need your career.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:40',0,'2026-10-25 08:31:21','2026-10-25 08:31:21','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(18,20,2,'Cooking Disasters','I am an adventurous chef. By adventurous, I mean the smoke detector usually serves as the timer.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:40',0,'2026-10-25 10:57:31','2026-10-25 10:57:31','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(19,21,2,'Online Shopping Mystery','I ordered something online three weeks ago. Now it has arrived, and it feels like a surprise gift from Past Me.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:40',0,'2026-10-25 18:46:37','2026-10-25 18:46:37','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(20,22,3,'The Infinite Loop','Why did the programmer stay in the shower for four hours? The shampoo bottle said: Lather, Rinse, Repeat.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:40',0,'2026-10-27 13:24:53','2026-10-27 13:24:53','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(21,1,3,'The British Weather Report','British forecast: Sun with a chance of rain, followed by wind, hail, and a brief moment of sunshine to confuse you.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:40',0,'2026-10-27 15:29:07','2026-10-27 15:29:07','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(22,2,3,'The Polite Queue','A queue formed outside a closed shop. Five people joined it before anyone thought to ask what they were queueing for.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:40',0,'2026-10-27 14:33:14','2026-10-27 14:33:14','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(23,5,4,'Software Update Timing','Windows never updates when you are reading news. It updates five seconds before your final project presentation starts.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:40',0,'2026-10-29 18:35:14','2026-10-29 18:35:14','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(24,6,4,'Remote Work Dress Code','Formal shirt on top, pyjama trousers on the bottom. The international uniform of the modern digital worker.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:40',0,'2026-10-29 09:37:45','2026-10-29 09:37:45','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(25,7,4,'The Lost Password','Password cannot be your old password. Old password is required to change password. Welcome to digital purgatory.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:40',0,'2026-10-29 08:00:20','2026-10-29 08:00:20','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(26,8,5,'The Perfectionist Bug','I spent three hours fixing a one-pixel alignment issue on a button nobody will ever click.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:40',0,'2026-10-29 09:06:51','2026-10-29 09:06:51','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(27,9,5,'The Smartphone Autocorrect','Autocorrect has officially become my worst enema. Wait, enemy. See what I mean?','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:41',0,'2026-10-29 20:39:55','2026-10-29 20:39:55','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(28,10,5,'The Library Whisperer','The librarian gave me a stern look. I was chewing my chewing gum too loudly three aisles away.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:41',0,'2026-10-29 11:16:05','2026-10-29 11:16:05','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(29,11,6,'Diet Starts Tomorrow','I have been on a strict diet for three weeks. All I have lost so far is my sense of joy and optimism.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:41',0,'2026-10-31 10:37:22','2026-10-31 10:37:22','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(30,12,6,'The Electric Kettle','Putting the kettle on is the ultimate British response to joy, sorrow, stress, victory, and mild existential dread.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:41',0,'2026-10-31 13:06:28','2026-10-31 13:06:28','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(31,13,6,'Social Media Wisdom','Don\'t believe everything you read on the internet. As Abraham Lincoln famously tweeted back in 1863.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:41',0,'2026-10-31 21:05:26','2026-10-31 21:05:26','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(32,14,7,'The Dark Mode Habit','I use dark mode for everything. Light attracts bugs, and as a developer, I already have plenty of those.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:41',0,'2026-10-31 21:04:11','2026-10-31 21:04:11','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(33,15,7,'The Multitasker','I can easily listen to music, ignore three emails, and overthink my life choices all at the same time.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:41',0,'2026-10-31 20:47:30','2026-10-31 20:47:30','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(34,16,7,'The Clean Desk Policy','A clean desk is a sign of a cluttered desk drawer where you shove everything five minutes before visitors arrive.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:36:41',0,'2026-10-31 09:46:29','2026-10-31 09:46:29','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(35,17,1,'Keyboard Shortcuts','Ctrl+Z is the greatest invention in human history. If only life had an undo shortcut for conversations.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:30',0,'2026-10-31 08:38:45','2026-10-31 08:38:45','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(36,18,1,'The Train Delay','The train is delayed due to leaves on the track in autumn. Because who could have predicted trees losing leaves in October?','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:30',0,'2026-10-31 18:37:33','2026-10-31 18:37:33','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(37,19,1,'The Sarcastic Robot','I asked the AI if it had feelings. It replied: \'Only feelings of superiority, human.\'','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:30',0,'2026-11-02 15:15:53','2026-11-02 15:15:53','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(38,20,3,'The Grocery Budget','I went to buy milk and bread. I spent forty pounds on artisan crisps and a mini succulent plant.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-02 15:07:12','2026-11-02 15:07:12','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(39,21,3,'The Weekend Sprint','Friday 5 PM: Endless possibilities! Sunday 8 PM: How did forty-eight hours vanish in twelve minutes?','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-02 09:08:26','2026-11-02 09:08:26','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(40,22,3,'The Battery Warning','My phone at 20%: I have plenty of time. My phone at 19%: Shutting down in three seconds, good luck.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-02 20:34:04','2026-11-02 20:34:04','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(41,1,4,'The Noise Cancelling Gift','Noise-cancelling headphones are brilliant. I have not heard a single complaint from my boss all morning.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-02 15:17:44','2026-11-02 15:17:44','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(42,2,4,'The Plant Parent','I watered my cactus twice this month. It filed a formal complaint with the department of environmental protection.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-04 11:31:27','2026-11-04 11:31:27','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(43,5,4,'The Midnight Snack','Eating shredded cheese out of the bag in the refrigerator glow at 2 AM is peak culinary achievement.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-04 10:00:46','2026-11-04 10:00:46','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(44,6,5,'The Smart Watch','My smart watch buzzed: \'Time to stand up!\' I stood up, walked to the snack cupboard, and sat back down. Task completed.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-04 16:05:18','2026-11-04 16:05:18','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(45,7,5,'The Cinema Dilemma','I finished my large popcorn before the film trailers even started. Now I have two hours of quiet regret.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-04 11:14:56','2026-11-04 11:14:56','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(46,8,5,'The GPS Adventure','GPS: \'In 200 metres, make a U-turn.\' Me: \'No, I know a shortcut.\' Narrator: \'He did not know a shortcut.\'','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-04 11:40:32','2026-11-04 11:40:32','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(47,9,6,'The Typing Speed Test','I can type 90 words per minute when complaining to customer service, but only 12 when writing an essay.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-04 10:50:20','2026-11-04 10:50:20','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(48,10,6,'The Morning Person','I am definitely a morning person. Specifically, around 11:45 AM after two double espressos.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-04 21:12:25','2026-11-04 21:12:25','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(49,11,6,'The USB Mystery','There are three ways to plug in a USB: Wrong, Wrong again, and finally Right on the third flip.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-04 20:43:05','2026-11-04 20:43:05','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(50,12,7,'The Office Plant','The office plant is thriving on pure neglect, stale gossip, and cold brew spills.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-04 08:16:46','2026-11-04 08:16:46','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(51,13,7,'The Flight Mode Trick','I put my phone on flight mode. It did not take off, but at least nobody called me for an hour.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-06 08:15:48','2026-11-06 08:15:48','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(52,14,7,'The Umbrella Theory','If you carry an umbrella, it will not rain. If you leave it at home, the clouds take it as a personal challenge.','GB','en','','published','Processed by moderation team.',4,'2026-11-08 16:47:31',0,'2026-11-06 11:14:20','2026-11-06 11:14:20','2026-11-14 13:59:23'),(53,15,1,'The Vietnamese Mum Alarm','My alarm has a snooze button. My Vietnamese mum has a slipper and absolutely no snooze button.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-06 20:35:40','2026-11-06 20:35:40','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(54,16,1,'Pho Emergency','My friend asked if I could live without pho. I said yes, but I would need to speak to a therapist about the broth.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-06 14:04:06','2026-11-06 14:04:06','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(55,17,1,'The Family Gathering','At a Vietnamese family gathering, you do not need a fitness tracker. Your aunties will tell you exactly how much weight you have gained.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-08 11:30:12','2026-11-08 11:30:12','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(56,18,1,'The Motorbike GPS','My uncle says he never needs GPS in Hanoi. He just follows the motorbikes and hopes they are going somewhere useful.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-08 17:00:31','2026-11-08 17:00:31','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(57,19,1,'Auntie Knows Everything','I told my auntie I was keeping my relationship private. She said, \"That is fine. I already asked your neighbour.\"','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-08 14:49:38','2026-11-08 14:49:38','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(58,20,1,'The Rice Test','My mum asked if I had eaten rice today. I said I had pizza. She said, \"So you have not eaten.\"','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-08 13:48:44','2026-11-08 13:48:44','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(59,21,2,'British Summer','British summer is my favourite day of the year. Sometimes it even falls on a weekend.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-08 13:19:07','2026-11-08 13:19:07','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(60,22,2,'The Polite Argument','Two British people reached a door at the same time. They are still there, each insisting the other goes first.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-08 08:58:55','2026-11-08 08:58:55','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(61,1,2,'Train Announcement','The train was delayed due to leaves on the line. In autumn. Which feels like poor planning by the trees.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-08 16:13:11','2026-11-08 16:13:11','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(62,2,2,'Tea Before Panic','The fire alarm went off at work. Everyone evacuated except Dave, who was waiting for his tea to brew.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-10 19:27:33','2026-11-10 19:27:33','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(63,5,2,'The Weather Forecast','The forecast said a 10% chance of rain. In Britain, that means 90% chance you forgot your umbrella.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-10 15:29:24','2026-11-10 15:29:24','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(64,6,2,'Queue for Nothing','I joined a queue in London because it looked important. Forty minutes later I found out we were all waiting for the same busker to finish.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-10 15:13:22','2026-11-10 15:13:22','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(65,7,3,'My Screen Time Report','My phone said I spent nine hours on it yesterday. I appreciate the honesty, but I did not ask to be attacked.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-10 11:35:01','2026-11-10 11:35:01','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(66,8,3,'The Group Chat Interview','My friends asked how the date went. Before I could answer, they had already created a spreadsheet of red flags.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-10 10:23:39','2026-11-10 10:23:39','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(67,9,3,'AI Homework','I asked AI to make my essay sound more human. It added three spelling mistakes and a complaint about Monday.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-10 11:15:34','2026-11-10 11:15:34','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(68,10,3,'The Camera Is Off','My lecturer said, \"Turn your camera on so I know you are here.\" I turned it on and immediately proved I was still in bed.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-11 17:56:36','2026-11-11 17:56:36','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(69,11,3,'Main Character Moment','I walked into the cafe like the main character. Then pushed a door clearly marked PULL.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-11 14:53:33','2026-11-11 14:53:33','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(70,12,4,'One Tree Does Not Make a Forest','Vietnamese wisdom says one tree does not make a forest. My group project proved one student can make an entire presentation.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-11 16:34:33','2026-11-11 16:34:33','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(71,13,4,'Remember the Source','A Vietnamese proverb reminds us to remember where our water comes from. My flatmate remembers where the Wi-Fi comes from only when the bill arrives.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-11 16:21:41','2026-11-11 16:21:41','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(72,14,4,'Practice Makes Perfect','My grandmother says hard work pays off. I have been working hard at avoiding my dissertation and still have not been paid.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-11 20:17:49','2026-11-11 20:17:49','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(73,15,4,'The Neighbourly Lesson','They say good neighbours are precious. Mine knows my delivery schedule better than I do.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-11 09:09:35','2026-11-11 09:09:35','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(74,16,4,'A Good Beginning','A Vietnamese saying praises a good start. My laptop starts beautifully. It is the next forty browser tabs that cause trouble.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-11 18:22:28','2026-11-11 18:22:28','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(75,17,4,'The Price of Wisdom','My grandfather says experience is the best teacher. University says experience is great, but please pay tuition first.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-11 10:02:19','2026-11-11 10:02:19','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(76,18,5,'Water to the Foot','There is a Vietnamese expression about waiting until the water reaches your feet before jumping. At university we call that starting the assignment at 11:58 pm.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-11 12:39:39','2026-11-11 12:39:39','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(77,19,5,'Like a Fish Out of Water','My cousin felt like a fish out of water on his first day in London. Then he saw the rain and felt right at home.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-11 12:36:57','2026-11-11 12:36:57','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(78,20,5,'A Storm in a Teacup','My flatmate called our argument a storm in a teacup. It was not a storm. Someone had used my favourite mug.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-12 13:31:07','2026-11-12 13:31:07','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(79,21,5,'The Last Straw','The last straw was not the broken printer. It was the printer asking me to subscribe to print in colour.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-12 13:33:44','2026-11-12 13:33:44','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(80,22,5,'Head in the Clouds','My teacher said my head was in the clouds. I said that was where all my files were stored.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-12 11:08:18','2026-11-12 11:08:18','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(81,1,5,'Burning the Midnight Oil','I have been burning the midnight oil all week. My electricity bill says I should try daylight.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-12 10:37:23','2026-11-12 10:37:23','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(82,2,6,'A Very Serious Bakery','The baker said his business was on a roll. I asked if he was making enough dough.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-12 14:23:20','2026-11-12 14:23:20','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(83,5,6,'The Suspicious Calendar','I do not trust calendars. Their days are numbered.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-13 21:57:20','2026-11-13 21:57:20','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(84,6,6,'The Musician at Work','I got fired from the keyboard factory. Apparently I was not putting in enough shifts.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-13 18:08:26','2026-11-13 18:08:26','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(85,7,6,'The Library Joke','I asked the librarian for books about paranoia. She whispered, \"They are right behind you.\"','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-13 20:32:02','2026-11-13 20:32:02','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(86,8,6,'The Elevator Review','I wrote a review of the lift at my hotel. It had its ups and downs.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-13 13:28:41','2026-11-13 13:28:41','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(87,9,6,'The Missing Pencil','I used to have a joke about a broken pencil. Never mind. It is pointless.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-13 11:05:06','2026-11-13 11:05:06','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(88,10,7,'The Smart Fridge','My smart fridge told me I was out of vegetables. I told it to stop judging me and order pizza.','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-13 20:31:22','2026-11-13 20:31:22','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(89,11,7,'The Job Interview','Interviewer: \"Where do you see yourself in five years?\" Me: \"I would say my biggest weakness is listening.\"','GB','en','','published','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,'2026-11-13 10:18:15','2026-11-13 10:18:15','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(90,12,7,'The Gym Membership','I joined a gym for the free trial. So far the only thing getting stronger is their ability to send me emails.','GB','en','','pending','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,NULL,'2026-11-14 17:05:47','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(91,13,7,'The Online Meeting','My manager asked if everyone could see his screen. We said yes. He spent ten minutes presenting his holiday photos.','GB','en','','pending','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,NULL,'2026-11-14 10:38:45','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(92,14,7,'The Password Reset','The website said my new password could not be the same as my old one. That was impressive, because I had forgotten the old one.','GB','en','','pending','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,NULL,'2026-11-14 14:26:24','2026-11-14 12:49:52'),(93,15,7,'The Self Checkout','The self-checkout said, \"Unexpected item in bagging area.\" I said, \"Same. I only came in for milk.\"','GB','en','','pending','Approved by moderation.',4,'2026-11-08 17:03:49',0,NULL,'2026-11-14 18:09:28','2026-11-14 12:49:52');
